  "body": "See [this example](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=9977):\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<div id=\"container1\"><span>Whatever</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"container2\"><span>Whatever</span></div>\r\n<script>\r\n  document.getElementById(\"container1\").innerText = \"\";\r\n  document.getElementById(\"container2\").firstChild.outerText = \"\";\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'd expect the two things to do the same (and per spec they do). However in implementations they don't and they leave an empty text-node.\r\n\r\ncc @smaug----",
